- Two copies of Urza's Saga to generate artifacts and eventually fetch key pieces\n\
- Planar Nexus for flexible mana\n\
- Karn, the Great Creator as a powerful win condition and artifact engine\n\
- Basalt Monolith for immediate mana acceleration\n\
- Manifold Key to untap key artifacts (especially Monoliths) for infinite loops\n\
\n\
While I'm missing Urza's Mine and Power-Plant, I can still generate a strong board presence. The two Sagas will quickly produce Constructs and let me fetch artifacts like Pili-Pala or Gneta Warden to generate infinite mana. Karn can also tutor for missing pieces.\n\
\n\
This hand is capable of going off as early as turn 3 or 4. I'm keeping it.\n\
\n\
